  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759314,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 11 Card Games - Nintendo DS\n\n**Bring the classic card game experience to your Nintendo DS with *11 Card Games*!**\n\nRondomedia delivers a portable powerhouse of entertainment, packing eleven beloved card games into one convenient cartridge. Forget needing a deck or a group – this module offers endless solo or multiplayer fun. \n\nDive into familiar favorites like Hearts, Spades, Euchre, Crazy Eights, and Gin Rummy, alongside lesser-known but equally engaging titles. Each game features clear, intuitive tutorials for beginners and adjustable difficulty levels to challenge seasoned card sharks. \n\nBeyond the core gameplay, *11 Card Games* boasts customizable rules, allowing you to tailor each game to your preferred style. Play against the AI or connect with friends locally for competitive matches.  Whether you're a casual player or a dedicated card enthusiast, this Nintendo DS title provides a comprehensive and endlessly replayable card game collection, perfect for travel or a quick gaming fix. Rediscover the joy of card games, anytime, anywhere!"
    },
